message: "If you cite or build on GuideCheck, cite the specification repository."
title: "GuideCheck: Human-Verifiable Assistant Guide profile"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-07
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rogers
    given-names: Sam
url: "https://guidecheck.org/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/snapsynapse/guidecheck"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: "GuideCheck is a constrained, plain-text, ASCII-only profile for assistant-guide.txt that a human can fully review before an AI assistant acts on it. The repository includes the normative profile, a verifier conformance profile, a reference verifier, and an instruction-surface scanner for hidden-instruction channels."
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - assistant-guide
  - prompt-injection
  - trust-boundary
  - verification
  - security-standard
